    "bodyHtml": "<p>I just finished a piece in my garage-studio. It’s acrylic on wood, 11”x11”x48”.</p><p>Here's a view of the top:</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Z9VQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc7aa7543-7bce-493d-9804-9d1daf3bde4e_1000x1000.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>As best I could manage, the mystery of innards is revealed .</p>",
