    "coverImage": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!O_36!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F77f04153-ade4-4101-be49-8c4350e6df2f_705x515.jpeg",
    "excerpt": "Was there ever a bigger swine than the man who…",
    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/tuesdays-quote-0c6",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Was there ever a bigger swine than the man who invented the expression time is money?</p><h5>Hans Arp, “Notes from a Dada Diary”, <em>The Dada Painters and Poets</em>, Robert Motherwell ed., New York: Wittenborn, Schultz, Inc., p. 221.</h5><h5>image: Steve Armstrong, <em>Bet on the Weather</em>, graphite on paper</h5>",
