    "excerpt": "I was having a pleasant time trying to imagine an…",
    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/still-life",
    "bodyHtml": "<div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!jnSU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5b076aec-f75b-4f42-a91a-44b41f2a5146_1000x60.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"1000\" height=\"60\"></picture></div></figure></div><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aY0L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdcc0da63-aee3-44eb-8cf1-9f6205cf202b_1000x750.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>I was having a pleasant time trying to imagine an ambiguous equation, or whether there really are any mathematical homonyms. But interesting times intervened in my peaceful thoughts about the beauty of impossible things.</p><p>I've heard it said that the use of force will ultimately lead to the opposite of the intended results. At the moment, as a trade war begins between Canada and the US, I viscerally feel that is true. It is a moment of truth for the vassal states of a declining empire.</p><h5>image: Steve Armstrong, untitled (still life with plastic cow and baggage tag), low resolution JPEG of natural light-unmanipulated iPhone 11 photograph, 2025.</h5>",
