    "subtitle": "Find Your Voice",
    "date": "2024-07-30T23:13:49.528Z",
    "coverImage": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!D4p0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcaa027f3-517d-4ffd-9aa6-92c537712c2b_1000x1411.jpeg",
    "excerpt": "Occasionally, I have the uncomfortable thought that making art is…",
    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/saul-steinberg-and-walter-murch",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>Occasionally, I have the uncomfortable thought that making art is too difficult and I must’ve been born too late. Then I think about being with the early Modernists, or the New York School, and I feel terribly sad. I would just be there doing paint-by-numbers standing on a beach while my feet slowly sink into the sand. All those problems were faced and solved and there’s nothing I could add.</p><p>And occasionally, with enormous respect, I think of Saul Steinberg and Walter Murch - they certainly found a way to be completely themselves. I can see there’s a way, I will find it. My Oedipal urges will outrun my nostalgia. I will press on against the grain.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uBe6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd96b3a4a-4246-4545-9345-1d2579a3518c_947x1195.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"947\" height=\"1195\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>This is Walter Tandy Murch, father of the Cinematographer Walter Scott Murch. I find this an impossibly beautiful painting.</p><p>***</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!newK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1365bdc5-b03c-4987-8ed5-ee3bbcdcb4e9_216x304.png 1456w\" width=\"216\" height=\"304\"></picture></div></figure></div><p><a href=\"https://www.lulu.com/shop/stephen-eric-armstrong-and-stephen-eric-armstrong-and-stephen-eric-armstrong/gathering-thoughts/paperback/product-5m89ne.html?q=gathering+thoughts&amp;page=1&amp;pageSize=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Information about my recent book is here.</a></p>",
