    "slug": "the-dark-star",
    "title": "The Dark Star",
    "subtitle": "Eclipse Report",
    "date": "2024-04-08T23:04:02.691Z",
    "coverImage": "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Ibtf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7ba4164b-e3fa-4ef9-bacf-8ae1c6fcc503_4032x3024.jpeg",
    "excerpt": "We went to our friends’ place on the North shore…",
    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/the-dark-star",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>We went to our friends’ place on the North shore of the Bay of Quinte to see the total eclipse on April 8th, 2024. With the heavy cloud cover I tried an iPhone photo with interesting results. Look a bit to the left of the sun to see an unexpected artifact of the lenses, that’s my guess what caused it. There’s a tiny blue crescent that corresponds with what I saw with the protective glasses.</p><p>Now take a look at the fabulous photo, also with an iPhone, our friend took. I don’t know how she did that but I’m glad she did. The Dark Star.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xPjL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F292f9981-0862-4302-80c0-74aab899f1b1_480x640.png 1456w\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\"></picture></div></figure></div>",
