    "excerpt": "I told a friend, who is also a subscriber, that…",
    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/secret-supposes",
    "bodyHtml": "<div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6lU1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F61965bdd-0ede-4eaa-804d-48a94399c0e0_460x252.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"460\" height=\"252\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>I told a friend, who is also a subscriber, that I write poetry but I was afraid to share it with anyone, and he asked me why and I said I don't know, so here is a poem.</p><p>I will eventually share other efforts: I've been working on a series of soliloquys under the title <em>Life During Wartime</em>.</p><p>The little painting in the gold frame is oil on pegboard, 18\" x 26\", 1985. I found the gold frame on the Internet somewhere, so I can't offer any credit or provenance.</p>",
