    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/strange-car",
    "bodyHtml": "<p>1931 Wikov Kapka (Czech)</p><p>A friend sent me this image: Big ears, tiny eyes, a leading nose, and what a colour. The back is even stranger.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kjM3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F17c41994-0137-4f92-a1f0-aea71a0cfee7_564x423.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"564\" height=\"423\"></picture></div></figure></div>",
