    "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>An image (ALPHABETVM ROMANORVM):</strong></p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"104\" height=\"99.97266514806378\"></picture></div></figure></div><p><strong>A quote from André Questcequecest:</strong></p><p>Ralph Waldo Emerson said, “Our housekeeping is mendicant, our arts, our occupations, our marriages, our religion we have not chosen, but society has chosen for us. We are parlour soldiers. The rugged battle of fate, where strength is born, we shun.”</p><p>Ralph Waldo Emerson, “Self-Reliance” in <em>Essays First and Second Series</em>, New York: National Book Company, 3,4,5 &amp; 6 Mission Place, 1894, First Series, p 69.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1456w\" width=\"82\" height=\"94.14814814814815\"></picture></div></figure></div><p><strong>A Fragment from the minutes of the Executive Council:</strong></p><p>We all have a metaphysics, it can’t be helped. Science answers the question “how?”, tempered by Hume of course, and the question “why?” is answered by our unexamined metaphysics.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P1i5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fac8b318a-b3db-4c92-8cbc-9616ecf91837_1057x1432.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"1057\" height=\"1432\"></picture></div></figure></div><p>Ralph Waldo Emerson (May 25, 1803 – April 27, 1882)</p><p><a href=\"https://wegway.substack.com/p/the-institute-for-the-separation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link to information on the ISTP </a></p><p>Please Subscribe, I probably won’t bother you more than once a week</p>",
