    "substackUrl": "https://wegway.substack.com/p/three-things-3",
    "bodyHtml": "<p><strong>An image (untitled, “one-piece collage”, 1984):</strong></p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLK6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb49bfd6-79b8-4e06-aaab-faa544f386ea_878x844.jpeg 1456w\" width=\"104\" height=\"99.97266514806378\"></picture></div></figure></div><p><strong>A quote from André Questcequecest:</strong></p><p>Tristan Tzara said, “Dada is a virgin microbe that penetrates with the insistence of air into all the spaces that reason has not been able to fill with words or conventions.”</p><p>Tristan Tzara in Theo van Doesburg, <em>What is Dada?</em>, Michael White trans., London: BCM Atlas Press, 2006, footnote 35, p. 89.</p><div><figure><div><picture><source srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1456w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hvm0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe4488283-3012-4916-a36a-8b2e4210b49d_162x186.png 1456w\" width=\"82\" height=\"94.14814814814815\"></picture></div></figure></div><p><strong>A Fragment from the minutes of the Executive Council:</strong> </p><p>Coyness increases the shelf life of bad art.</p><p><a href=\"https://wegway.substack.com/p/the-institute-for-the-separation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Link to information on the ISTP </a></p><p>Please Subscribe, I probably won’t bother you more than once a week</p>",
